==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**14,200 grants +20 Feathers.
**14,300 grants +20 Coal.
**14,400 grants +20 Gears.
*Added 1 new item: Cat Nets.
*Added the [[Cat Scratcher]].
*Track O' Fortuna replaced.
*Added [[Talent Orbs]] for [[Massive Damage]], [[Strong Against]] and [[Resistant]].
*[[Zollow]] gains [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] trait.
*"Jump to [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]]" function removed.
**New button that allows you to fast travel between story chapters without going to the [[Main Menu]].
*Replaced Starred Difficulties with Crowned Difficulties. Stars now indicate the general difficulty of a stage.

